[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわあああ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aaaahhh!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "村人Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Villager A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫かい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You okay there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "た、助かった……ありがとう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'm saved... Thank you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "村人Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Villager A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいから早く逃げるんだね。\nここは危ない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't mention it, just get out of here fast. This place is dangerous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあああっ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haaahhh!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私が来たからにはもう安心だぞ！\nさあ、後ろに下がってるんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that I'm here, you can rest easy! Come on, get behind me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このまま倒しきっちゃおう。\n「管理」も捗って一石二鳥だしねっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's finish them all off while we're at it. It'll help with our management duties too—talk about two birds with one stone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "村人が危機に陥ってる中でそのような発言は\n不謹慎ですが……「管理」には同意です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's an insensitive comment to make while villagers are facing immediate danger... but you aren't wrong."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "殲滅、いたします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Commencing annihilation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これで全部か？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Is that all of them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "村を襲いに来たのは倒せたんじゃないかい？\nどこかの巣にまだ潜んでいる可能性はあるだろうが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think we got the ones that came to attack the village. There might still be some lurking in a nest somewhere, though."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物の巣ならこちらで見つけ、適切な「管理」を\n行いました。村を襲う余力はもう無いでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We found the monster nest and managed it accordingly. They shouldn't have the strength left to attack the village."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とはいえ、近くに魔物がいるのは変わりないよ。\nこんな僻地に村を作ったのがそもそもの間違いさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even so, there are still monsters nearby. Building a village in such a remote place was a mistake to begin with."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それもそうだな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's true..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "村の皆！\u3000聞いてくれ！\u3000ここは安全ではない！\n可能ならケイウン本土に居を移すべきだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone! Listen up! This place isn't safe! If possible, you should relocate to the Keiun mainland!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケイウン本土からそう離れてもいない。\n船を出してもらえれば、すぐだろうさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's not that far to the Keiun mainland. If we could get a boat, the journey will be quick."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうだい？\u3000ケイウンへの話なら\nアタシたちが付けたっていい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you say? We could arrange passage to Keiun for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "村人たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Villagers"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その……お姉さんの言うことはありがたいんだけどね。\nそれができない事情っていうもんがあるのさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... We're grateful for your offer, miss. But there are circumstances that make that impossible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "村人Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Villager B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "事情？\u3000それって命よりも大切なものなわけ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Circumstances? More important than your lives?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……俺たちはこの島から出ることを\n許されていないのさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...We're not allowed to leave this island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "村人Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Villager C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケイウンで罪を犯した、罪人だからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're criminals who committed crimes in Keiun."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "村人Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Villager C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここは「鬼界島」。鬼として扱われた罪人が、\n島流しの末たどり着く……監獄だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is Kikai—the Devil's Island. A prison where criminals treated like demons end up after being exiled."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "村人Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Villager C"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]